{"id":"652695","name":"鲍鱼汁炒年糕","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/652695/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"年糕","amount":"250克"}],"sub":[{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备:年糕，洋葱。","img":"images/652695/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洋葱切丝。","img":"images/652695/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"年糕切条。","img":"images/652695/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"碗里放入鲍鱼汁，泰式酱，番茄酱，生粉。","img":"images/652695/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"添加适量的水调好碗汁就好了。","img":"images/652695/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"年糕条入开水锅里煮熟透约五分钟，再捞出来过冷河。","img":"images/652695/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"小奶锅放油，油热了放入洋葱丝炒香。","img":"images/652695/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入年糕条。","img":"images/652695/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入碗汁。","img":"images/652695/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"中火用筷子搅拌让年糕均匀入味。","img":"images/652695/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"炒至酱汁变浓稠了就可以了。","img":"images/652695/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/652695/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/652695/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/652695/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}